<title>USA: Deluxe Corp Q3 net up.</title>
<headline>Deluxe Corp Q3 net up.</headline>
<dateline>ST. PAUL, Minn. 1996-10-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Oper shr		    $0.41		    $0.37</p>
<p> Oper net		   33,500		   30,300</p>
<p> Revs			460,500		  449,200</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   82,300		   82,400</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)  </p>
<p>			NINE MONTHS</p>
<p> Oper shr		  $  1.10		  $  1.16</p>
<p> Oper net		   90,500		   95,600</p>
<p> Revs		    1,415,200		1,356,900</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   82,300		   82,400</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1996 operating net includes pre-tax restructuring charge of $34.8 million or $0.25 after tax.</p>
<p>1995 operating net excludes loss from discontinued operations of $900,000 or $0.01 a share in the third quarter and a loss of $2.7 million or $0.03 a share for the nine months period.</p>
<p>	     Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8787</p>
